# Generated subagent definitions (`dv-*.md`) are written here at runtime by the
# SessionStart hook (`deepvista agents export`) — one per DeepVista managed-agent
# role. They re-export on every session start, so a marketplace `git pull` that
# wipes them is self-healing. We ignore the prefix so generated defs do not show
# up as local modifications, stay out of plugin PR diffs, and survive the brief
# window between a `git pull` and the hook writing them back.
#
# Hand-curated agents committed here (without the `dv-` prefix) are tracked
# normally and always win over a generated role of the same name.
dv-*.md
